module j3.term.ansi — ANSI/VT escape parser: the Paul Williams DEC VT500 state machine plus UTF-8 decoding in the ground

fn: feed strip toRuns sgr
const: MAX_PARAMS MAX_OSC MAX_APC
trait Sink: print() exec() csi() esc() osc() apc()
struct Params: v colon n marker inter ninter curok bad count() start() param() subCount() sub()
struct Parser: state p osc oscLen oscBad apc cp need min out redo new() reset()
struct Run: start len style

signatures and comments: `j3c doc j3.term.ansi`; one name: `j3c doc j3.term.ansi <name>`
--- stderr
--- exit 0
